  "name": "Apex Predator",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your experience and skill allow you to hunt and fight any creature as effectively as your chosen foes, given a little time to prepare. When you finish a Long Rest, you can exchange any of your chosen favorite enemies and replace them with a different one.</p><p>Additionally, your critical range against your favorite enemies increases by 1 and if you land a critical hit with a weapon attack, you add your ranger level to the damage roll.</p>",
